<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Sherwood Medical to create 102 jobs in Offaly.</title>
<headline>Sherwood Medical to create 102 jobs in Offaly.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sherwood Medical Industries will create 102 additional jobs at its plant in Tullamore, County Offaly, Irish employment minister Richard Bruton said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company, which has decided to manufacture chest drainage products in addition to its existing range, will invest 1.3 million Irish pounds in capital equipment, Bruton said in a statement.</p>
<p>The investment is backed by IDA Ireland, the Irish industrial development authority.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
